{"id":"B1-L154","title":"Defining relative clauses — introduction","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U09","focus":"Defining relative clauses — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Defining relative clauses — introdução","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["history class","tiny room","inspiring book","caring person","learning love","study corner","school library","chalk board","desk row","hall monitor","history book","first teacher","school gate","reading nook","young student","dining room","comic","memorable"],"field":"Cultura","genre":"Editorial / opinião","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 154 · Defining relative clauses — introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Defining relative clauses — introdução.","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (cultura).","**Texto do dia:** editorial / opinião."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo usar orações relativas restritivas (who, which, that, where) num editorial."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["history class","aula de história"],["tiny room","sala minúscula"],["inspiring book","livro inspirador"],["caring person","pessoa atenciosa"],["learning love","amor por aprender"],["study corner","cantinho de estudo"],["school library","biblioteca escolar"],["chalk board","quadro-negro"],["desk row","fileira de carteiras"],["hall monitor","monitor de corredor"],["history book","livro de história"],["first teacher","primeira professora"],["school gate","portão da escola"],["reading nook","cantinho de leitura"],["young student","jovem estudante"],["dining room","dining room"],["comic","comic"],["memorable","memorable"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An editorial","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Teachers Who Changed Me","paras":["The teacher **who** helped me most was Ms. Lima. She was a person **who** listened. The class **that** I loved was history, and the room **where** we studied was tiny.","Schools should hire people **who** love learning and books **that** inspire. **In my opinion**, those are the things **which** matter."],"kicker":"OPINION","by":"School Voice","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ms. Lima listened to students.","ans":"T","why":"a person who listened."},{"q":"The history room was huge.","ans":"F","why":"tiny."},{"q":"The writer likes books that inspire.","ans":"T","why":"books that inspire."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“inspire” = ?","opts":["inspirar","inspecionar","instalar"],"ans":0,"why":"inspire."},{"q":"“tiny” = ?","opts":["minúsculo","tímido","tênis"],"ans":0,"why":"tiny."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Orações relativas restritivas","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pronome","Para…","Exemplo"],"rows":[["who","pessoas","**the teacher who helped me**"],["which / that","coisas","**the class that I loved**"],["where","lugares","**the room where we studied**"],["that","pessoas ou coisas","**a person that listened**"]],"cap":"Orações relativas restritivas"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Sem vírgula: a oração **identifica** o substantivo. Com *that* ou *which*, o pronome pode sumir quando é objeto: *the class (that) I loved*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"The teacher ___ helped me was Ms. Lima. (who)","a":"who","why":"pessoa."},{"s":"The class ___ I loved was history. (that)","a":"that","why":"coisa."},{"s":"The room ___ we studied was tiny. (where)","a":"where","why":"lugar."},{"s":"Books ___ inspire matter. (that)","a":"that","why":"coisa."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["favorite teacher","professora favorita"],["history class","aula de história"],["tiny room","sala minúscula"],["inspiring book","livro inspirador"],["caring person","pessoa atenciosa"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["class","that","you","loved","And","the"],"ans":"And the class that you loved","pt":"E a aula de que gostava?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"history class","pos":"word","pt":"aula de história","ex":"History class.","expt":"Aula de história."},{"w":"tiny room","pos":"word","pt":"sala minúscula","ex":"Tiny room.","expt":"Sala minúscula."},{"w":"inspiring book","pos":"word","pt":"livro inspirador","ex":"Inspiring book.","expt":"Livro inspirador."},{"w":"caring person","pos":"word","pt":"pessoa atenciosa","ex":"Caring person.","expt":"Pessoa atenciosa."},{"w":"learning love","pos":"word","pt":"amor por aprender","ex":"Learning love.","expt":"Amor por aprender."},{"w":"study corner","pos":"word","pt":"cantinho de estudo","ex":"Study corner.","expt":"Cantinho de estudo."},{"w":"school library","pos":"word","pt":"biblioteca escolar","ex":"School library.","expt":"Biblioteca escolar."},{"w":"chalk board","pos":"word","pt":"quadro-negro","ex":"Chalk board.","expt":"Quadro-negro."},{"w":"desk row","pos":"word","pt":"fileira de carteiras","ex":"Desk row.","expt":"Fileira de carteiras."},{"w":"hall monitor","pos":"word","pt":"monitor de corredor","ex":"Hall monitor.","expt":"Monitor de corredor."},{"w":"history book","pos":"word","pt":"livro de história","ex":"History book.","expt":"Livro de história."},{"w":"first teacher","pos":"word","pt":"primeira professora","ex":"First teacher.","expt":"Primeira professora."},{"w":"school gate","pos":"word","pt":"portão da escola","ex":"School gate.","expt":"Portão da escola."},{"w":"reading nook","pos":"word","pt":"cantinho de leitura","ex":"Reading nook.","expt":"Cantinho de leitura."},{"w":"young student","pos":"word","pt":"jovem estudante","ex":"Young student.","expt":"Jovem estudante."},{"w":"dining room","pos":"word","pt":"dining room","ex":"sala de jantar","expt":"A formal dining room."},{"w":"comic","pos":"word","pt":"comic","ex":"história em quadrinhos","expt":"A funny comic."},{"w":"memorable","pos":"word","pt":"memorable","ex":"memorável","expt":"A memorable trip."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Teacher’s pet.** — Queridinho do professor.","**Top of the class.** — O melhor da turma.","**School of thought.** — Corrente de pensamento.","**Learn the hard way.** — Aprender na marra.","**And the class that you loved?** — E a aula de que gostava?","**Who was the teacher who helped you most?** — Quem foi a professora que mais ajudou?","**Ms. Lima. She was a person who listened.** — A Sra. Lima. Era alguém que ouvia.","**Go Dutch.** — Cada um paga o seu."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"inspire","pt":"inspirar","forms":[["I / you / we / they inspire","Books inspire me."],["he / she / it inspires","Livros me inspiram."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Memories","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Memories","lines":[["Ana","Who was the teacher who helped you most?","Quem foi a professora que mais ajudou?"],["Leo","Ms. Lima. She was a person who listened.","A Sra. Lima. Era alguém que ouvia."],["Ana","And the class that you loved?","E a aula de que gostava?"],["Leo","History, in a tiny room where we all fit.","História, numa sala minúscula onde todos cabíamos."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe a person with who.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"She is a teacher who listens."},{"q":"Describe a thing with that.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"It is a book that inspires."},{"q":"Describe a place with where.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"It is the room where we met."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with who / that / which / where.","model":"The teacher who helped me was Ms. Lima. The class that I loved was history. The room where we studied was tiny. I like books that inspire. Schools need people who love learning.","checklist":["Usei **who/that/where**","5 frases"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “favorite teacher” mean?","opts":["professora favorita","aula de história","livro inspirador"],"ans":0,"why":"**favorite teacher** = professora favorita."},{"q":"What does “history class” mean?","opts":["sala minúscula","aula de história","pessoa atenciosa"],"ans":1,"why":"**history class** = aula de história."},{"q":"What does “tiny room” mean?","opts":["livro inspirador","memória escolar","sala minúscula"],"ans":2,"why":"**tiny room** = sala minúscula."},{"q":"What does “inspiring book” mean?","opts":["livro inspirador","pessoa atenciosa","professora da turma"],"ans":0,"why":"**inspiring book** = livro inspirador."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}